# BuildKit needs the ** glob to match nested workspace dirs.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/lib
**/.expo
**/web-build
.git
*.log
.DS_Store
# A local incremental-build record makes `tsc` inside the image skip emitting
# (the matching dist/ is excluded above), which fails the backend build with
# TS6305. Measured building the image from a developer checkout.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# Local env files hold real credentials and the build reads none of them;
# `COPY packages/backend/` would otherwise put a developer's .env in a layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
